  "_comment": "Wave composer data (Docs/Waves.md). Edited live with F8 > Waves; counts are per lane. waveOrder \"campaign\": the 15 waves are played straight through the 3-cycle match (wavesPerCycle 5 each) and wrap; \"cycle\" replays the list every cycle.",
