  "pacing": {
    "_comment": "breatherSeconds is the Skill Shop window after each cleared wave; earlyContinue ends it once every human is Ready. Waves appear spawnAlongRoute of the way down the road (0 = at the rift, per Eric) and walk marchSpeed x faster while not fighting; with no defender within rallyRadius cm they hurry at rallySpeed x (the 3x-longer town); idle bots hold at botHoldAt of the route (Docs/Waves.md).",
